se we've got  customers all over the world  my company's cost for multi region  storage is 2.6 cents per  a bite so the total cost for  multi-regional storage this month is  going to be one thousand five hundred  ninety seven dollars and forty four  cents the majority of my company's music  is held in the multi-regional storage so  that each song can be as accessible as  possible  the next expense is also for data  storage but this is for a Nearline  storage Nearline storage as you'd  remember is a low-cost highly durable  storage service for storing in  frequently accessed data it's a better  choice than multi-regional storage or  regional storage in scenarios were  slightly lower availability 30-day  minimum storage duration and cost for  data access are acceptable trade-offs  for lower storage costs Nearline storage  is ideal for infrequently read or  modified data we're talking once a month  or less and Nearline storage is also  appropriate for data backup disaster  recovery and archival storage at gents  jams we use Nearline storage to backup  our music collection in the event that a  song gets lost I also use Nearline  storage for songs that are rarely ever  downloaded Nearline storage for the u.s.  multi-region location is one cent per  gigabyte so the total cost here is 1,024  dollars notice that this is less than  the total cost of multi-regional storage  even though i'm storing more data next  up in my pricing table is network costs  network usage charges apply when an  object or object metadata is read from  your buckets that is egress the cost  depends on several factors and includes  caveats for example like circumstances  with the network egress within GCP for  example data egress from your bucket to  an on cloud storage Google cloud  platform service is free if your bucket  is located in a region the GCP service  is located in a multi region and both  locations are on the same continent so  accessing data in a u.s. East one bucket  with a US App Engin